# AWS Deployment Guide — AI Interviewer

## Is It Free?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **AWS Free Tier (first 12 months):** Almost entirely free if you stay within limits.
> **After 12 months:** Approx **$20–30/month** depending on traffic.

| Service | Free Tier | After Free Tier |
|---|---|---|
| EC2 t3.micro (backend) | 750 hrs/month FREE | ~$8–10/month |
| RDS PostgreSQL t3.micro | 750 hrs/month FREE | ~$13–15/month |
| S3 (frontend files) | 5GB + 20k requests FREE | ~$0.02/GB |
| CloudFront (CDN) | 1TB transfer FREE | ~$0.01/GB |
| **Groq API** | Has free tier | Pay-per-token |
| **Deepgram API** | $200 free credit | Pay-per-minute |

> [!NOTE]
> Your **Groq** and **Deepgram** API costs are separate from AWS — billed directly by those providers.

