## Architecture

```
Users (Browser)
    │
    ▼
CloudFront + S3          ← Frontend (React build, HTTPS)
    │
    ▼
EC2 t3.micro             ← Backend (Node.js + WebRTC)
    │         │
    ▼         ▼
RDS Postgres  Groq / Deepgram APIs
```

