## Updating the App Later

```bash
# Backend update (on EC2)
cd ~/ai-interviewer/backend
git pull
npm install
pm2 restart ai-interviewer-backend

# Frontend update (locally → re-deploy to S3)
cd frontend
npm run build
aws s3 sync ./dist s3://ai-interviewer-frontend --delete
```

