## Cost Summary

| Scenario | Monthly Cost |
|---|---|
| Within AWS 12-month free tier | **~$0** |
| After free tier (EC2 + RDS) | **~$20–28/month** |
| After free tier (EC2 only + Neon free DB) | **~$8–10/month** |
| Groq API | Free tier, then pay-per-token |
| Deepgram API | $200 free credit, then ~$0.006/min |

> [!TIP]
> **Cheapest long-term setup:** EC2 t3.micro + Neon (free Postgres) + S3 + CloudFront = **~$8–10/month after free tier**.
